# The generation model, built with the context this project needs.
#
# Ollama's OpenAI-compatible /v1 route accepts an `options` block and ignores
# it, measured on 0.33.1 against both gemma2:9b and qwen3.8:27b. A Modelfile
# parameter is honoured through that route, so the context lives here rather
# than in each caller.
#
# 32768 rather than the 131072 ceiling the card holds. The agent sends a
# retrieval result, not the whole Act, and the KV cache at 131072 accounts for
# 11 to 12 GB of a 32.6 GB card that other work on this machine also wants.
# The evaluation harness's full-context arm is what needs the ceiling, and it
# builds its own model rather than widening this one.
#
# Build with scripts/ollama-build.sh.

FROM qwen3.8:27b

PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
